> 
> > The SPDIF output on CS46xx-based sound card unlikely works.
> > It's a long-standing bug that transferring non-audio often breaks
> > because of lack of proper SPDIF status bits setting.
> >
> > I have no clue yet what to fix this...
> >
> I do not know if I understood U correctly but at the moment 5.1
> surround sound is not possible with Hercules Fortissimo II, correct?

It depends on what you need for your surround box.  If you connect the
digital (SPDIF) output for AC3/DTS, it doesn't work.  If you connect 3
analog output jacks, it *might* work.  The 5.1 *analog* output is
supported on *some* boards with cs46xx chip.


